# A card is encoded on a creature only while the creature stays on the battlefield (CR 702.99c). Llanowar Elves, with
# Trait Doctoring encoded on it, deals combat damage to Bot2; with the trigger on the stack Bot2 kills the Elves with
# Lightning Bolt. When the trigger resolves nothing is encoded on that creature any more, so no copy is offered, and
# the card stays in exile.

